{"id":"658154","name":"木耳鸡胸肉焖老豆腐","author":"开心肥羊","authorId":"389860","desc":"","cover":"images/658154/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"老豆腐","amount":"400g"},{"name":"干木耳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜苗","amount":"150g"},{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"鸡粉","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"老豆腐切小块。","img":"images/658154/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蒜苗切段备用。","img":"images/658154/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"干木耳泡发洗净备用。","img":"images/658154/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡胸肉切条，用少许生粉、生抽，腌制15分钟。","img":"images/658154/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中倒入适量油，下如蒜苗的茎爆香。","img":"images/658154/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再倒入鸡胸肉，翻炒一下。","img":"images/658154/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"然后倒入木耳及蒜苗叶，继续翻炒。","img":"images/658154/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再加入老豆腐。","img":"images/658154/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"撒入盐和鸡粉。","img":"images/658154/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"还有胡椒粉，翻炒一下。","img":"images/658154/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"最后滴入生抽，翻拌均匀后倒入一碗清水，小火焖煮10分钟即可。","img":"images/658154/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}